1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,268
Hello Priya, I'm Ravi speaking from the school office.

2
00:00:05,268 --> 00:00:11,999
I'm calling to inquire about the science trip for Class 9 next month.

3
00:00:11,999 --> 00:00:18,243
The bus will depart from the school gate on the 14th at 7:30 AM.

4
00:00:18,243 --> 00:00:25,950
Please ask every student to bring a packed lunch, water bottle, and a notebook.

5
00:00:25,950 --> 00:00:32,430
We will first go to the planetarium and the show will start at ten o'clock, after

6
00:00:32,430 --> 00:00:38,590
which we will go to the botanical garden where a guide will explain to us how

7
00:00:38,590 --> 00:00:40,430
plants make their food.

8
00:00:40,430 --> 00:00:44,190
Lunch will be around one o'clock in the garden.

9
00:00:44,190 --> 00:00:50,670
The fee is three hundred and fifty rupees per student and it includes bus tickets

10
00:00:50,670 --> 00:00:51,630
and a guide.

11
00:00:51,630 --> 00:00:57,063
Please collect the money and signed permission slips by Friday.

12
00:00:57,063 --> 00:01:03,617
So far, forty-two students have registered, and we have room for fifty more.

13
00:01:03,617 --> 00:01:10,343
If any student needs help with the fees, please let me know privately, and the

14
00:01:10,343 --> 00:01:12,758
school will take care of it.

15
00:01:12,758 --> 00:01:16,380
Two parents have offered to come together.

16
00:01:16,380 --> 00:01:21,100
But we still need another teacher, can you ask Mr.

17
00:01:21,100 --> 00:01:24,403
Sharma if he is available that day?

18
00:01:24,403 --> 00:01:29,123
We should return to school by 5 PM in the evening.

19
00:01:29,123 --> 00:01:34,220
Parents can pick up their children from the main gate.

20
00:01:34,220 --> 00:01:41,300
I will send the complete plan to the class group by Wednesday, if it rains.

21
00:01:41,300 --> 00:01:47,337
Instead of a picnic, there will be a visit to the science museum.

22
00:01:47,337 --> 00:01:53,931
The museum has a new section on space, so students will still enjoy it.

23
00:01:53,931 --> 00:02:01,268
Please remind students to wear their school ID cards; students who forget their

24
00:02:01,268 --> 00:02:07,305
identification card will not be allowed to enter the planetarium.

25
00:02:07,305 --> 00:02:08,420
Furthermore,

26
00:02:08,420 --> 00:02:15,491
No one should bring a mobile phone for emergencies, we will have teachers' phones

27
00:02:15,491 --> 00:02:16,364
available.

28
00:02:16,364 --> 00:02:22,300
The emergency contact number for travel is the school office number.

29
00:02:22,300 --> 00:02:29,371
Another thing is that three students are allergic to food, and their parents have

30
00:02:29,371 --> 00:02:30,332
sent notes.

31
00:02:30,332 --> 00:02:34,260
I will give you those notes tomorrow morning.

32
00:02:34,260 --> 00:02:41,170
thanks for helping me with this and call me back if you have any questions
